Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.50,0:00:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn on forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting bones,\Nwe'll reach it, we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.94,0:00:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,so truly grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran into you on that day so long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.74,0:00:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We laughed every moment\Nwith tears in our eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.48,0:00:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Till we knew we weren't alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The blowing wind came in\Nand joined us on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.22,0:00:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And with it I know we'll rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.18,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be flying up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.88,0:00:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why are you giving up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.46,0:00:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why you want to fight alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what kind of future\Ndo you think you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.88,0:01:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dream is already in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.28,0:01:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn off forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.02,0:01:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.98,0:01:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting possible\Nreaching, we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.72,0:01:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,From the horizon, out on\Nthe edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.62,0:01:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a place that\NI want to take you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.56,0:01:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head for it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But as for the way, we already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.26,0:01:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.36,0:01:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You scream by your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't break through the silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.32,0:01:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.90,0:01:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It crushes your helpless heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got your back, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll always be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.26,0:01:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put our fate within\Nthis light under the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.96,0:02:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you close your eyes and\Njust listen to my voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find the answer together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.18,0:02:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you in our path.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.68,0:02:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust that it will lead us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.70,0:02:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,To another sea untarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.60,0:02:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause now we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.52,0:02:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,On the horizon, out on\Nthe edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.28,0:02:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a place that\NI want to take you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.28,0:02:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head for it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.78,0:02:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But after the way, we already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.20,0:02:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.90,0:02:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that ruckus?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.74,0:02:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard a loud noise coming from\Nover there Was it an intruder?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.84,0:02:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.06,0:02:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.82,0:02:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Bobbin, sir, what happened to the wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.54,0:02:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell us you were under attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.04,0:03:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Did somebody try to hurt you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.50,0:03:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It was nothing unusual, but rest\Nassured, you can all take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.50,0:03:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Bobbin, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.90,0:03:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.26,0:03:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can take care of this\Nlittle problem myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.08,0:03:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.56,0:03:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.64,0:03:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the demons from\NHell itself wouldn't dare
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.66,0:03:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,turn down an invitation\Nto Mama's Tea Party.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.50,0:03:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Magic Mirror!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.92,0:03:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Tia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.48,0:03:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.60,0:03:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh, I think there's\Nsomething right behind Brooke.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.62,0:04:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.54,0:04:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be quite troublesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.44,0:04:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's the plan if\Nyou need it spelled out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.90,0:04:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That mirror leads to mama's bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.24,0:04:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's one of the emperors of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.96,0:04:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,At the very least he's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.44,0:04:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be messy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.88,0:04:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he there of all places?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.16,0:04:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, why is she sleeping with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.34,0:04:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He seems to be deep in slumber himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.30,0:04:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How can he relax right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.20,0:05:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Brock, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.46,0:05:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No use.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.76,0:05:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess he can't hear you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.26,0:05:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck trying to\Nget Mama to let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.24,0:05:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,She adores oddities like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.86,0:05:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't fret.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.04,0:05:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can help you out by making\Nher loosen up her grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.34,0:05:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.18,0:05:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me, Barrel! Chouchou!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.98,0:05:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Chouchou!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.52,0:05:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.80,0:05:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.38,0:05:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.70,0:05:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you think she heard us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.08,0:05:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.60,0:05:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. Still out cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She, she, she knows that we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.66,0:05:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.57,0:06:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.98,0:06:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.89,0:06:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.44,0:06:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Who's there? The boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.14,0:06:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, he's up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.54,0:06:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Bear, can you hear us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.80,0:06:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.26,0:06:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.90,0:06:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The freak?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.70,0:06:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What, Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.30,0:06:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We're under attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.72,0:06:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I need my freak! You'll go! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.22,0:06:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.94,0:07:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they really that powerful?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.12,0:07:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are we supposed to save him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.76,0:07:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just killing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.16,0:07:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This looks grim!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.12,0:07:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.88,0:07:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That food doesn't belong to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.22,0:08:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.46,0:08:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's somebody really\Nimportant I've got to give this to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.32,0:08:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.76,0:08:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I think this baby needs some more hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.28,0:08:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How's this, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.64,0:08:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Eating improvement? For sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.94,0:08:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Way more convincing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.22,0:08:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you even find this guy, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.28,0:08:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's from the execution grounds here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.86,0:08:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The Afro is made of\Nseaweed from the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.50,0:08:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, our friend here is good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.40,0:08:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, he looks exactly like Brook. Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.40,0:08:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can just switch him\Nout with the real Brook,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.96,0:08:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think she'll\Neven notice he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.14,0:08:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.92,0:09:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now if we place Barrel at\Nthe midpoint between worlds,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.36,0:09:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,we should be able to easily enter and\Nexit the giant mirror as we please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.20,0:09:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.40,0:09:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I'll make them pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.70,0:09:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And with that, I believe\Nwe're all set now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.18,0:09:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall we get to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.20,0:09:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the Brook Rescue Mission commence!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.12,0:09:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Challenge one!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.66,0:09:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wish me luck! Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.80,0:09:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, you can't make any noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.04,0:09:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You can count on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.12,0:09:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.48,0:09:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, wait for me, Brooke.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.88,0:09:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.78,0:10:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't scream!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.00,0:10:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I was scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.36,0:10:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So incredibly scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.36,0:10:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you two okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.22,0:10:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody else needs to do it then. Let me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.48,0:10:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure to get the job done!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.66,0:10:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Challenge two!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.66,0:10:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.00,0:10:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.74,0:10:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Brooke!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.65,0:10:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Brooke, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.04,0:10:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta go, sleepyhead! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.90,0:10:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The bubble is getting\Nbigger! Leave now! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.22,0:10:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Did she notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.96,0:10:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's looking right at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.44,0:11:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.40,0:11:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.58,0:11:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A stuffed bunny defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.48,0:11:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't fall for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.24,0:11:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.98,0:11:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's just a stuffed bunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.08,0:11:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that really worked? Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.62,0:11:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your chance, Carrot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.42,0:11:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.90,0:11:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that damn fly again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.18,0:11:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What an annoying pet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.90,0:11:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.04,0:11:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So incredibly scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.72,0:11:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, who's up next?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.94,0:11:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What an embarrassing display.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.84,0:11:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.14,0:12:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.34,0:12:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Challenge three!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.08,0:12:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Brooke!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.26,0:12:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to head out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.18,0:12:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.42,0:12:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,She rolled over!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.34,0:12:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Did that wake him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.40,0:12:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.54,0:12:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's out of Big Mom's hands now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.50,0:12:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let me have a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.48,0:12:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Challenge four.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.00,0:12:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Brock! Hey, get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.96,0:12:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiya, Brock!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.90,0:12:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.81,0:12:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.28,0:12:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.90,0:13:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.40,0:13:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.48,0:13:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to save you stupid fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.94,0:13:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavenly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.86,0:13:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.38,0:13:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice work!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.50,0:13:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That was way too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.68,0:13:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbei, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.00,0:13:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mission accomplished!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.90,0:13:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.84,0:13:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That was scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.76,0:13:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.70,0:14:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like you really\Nmessed these guys up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.92,0:14:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing you said your goodbyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.24,0:14:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It turns out we're holding Straw Hat and\Nthe Cat Burglar captive in the library.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.14,0:14:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy fought all night against one of\NBig Mom's strongest generals to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.60,0:15:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in no shape to do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.96,0:15:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you told me you'd be waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.48,0:15:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell are you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.12,0:15:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.14,0:15:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.40,0:15:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.26,0:15:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm utterly shocked!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.08,0:15:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, ah, ah, about everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.12,0:15:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not have it, Dr. Speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.22,0:15:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You picked the worst type thing out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.04,0:15:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I sincerely thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.76,0:15:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All that matters is that you're safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.90,0:16:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I thought I was dead for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.70,0:16:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Or rather, double dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.46,0:16:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,With the heightened security,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.16,0:16:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have realized sooner\Nthat we would be unable
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.78,0:16:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,to make a copy of the Road\NPoneglyph on this trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.30,0:16:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my fault for pushing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.36,0:16:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I needlessly put your life at risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.46,0:16:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.40,0:16:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.06,0:16:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You selflessly stuck your neck out for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.56,0:16:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Had it not been for your bold idea\Nto infiltrate as a two-man team,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.44,0:16:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,we never would have had\Nthis golden opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.92,0:16:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If we attempted to take the stone\Nrubbings on any other occasion,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.76,0:16:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,there would have been no way\Nto avoid an Alto pirate war.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.90,0:16:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We had to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.74,0:16:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite the poor odds,\Nit was our only option.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.40,0:16:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, the copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.32,0:17:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I can't tell you how glad I\Nam that you got away safely, Pedro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.02,0:17:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The copy I wish our plan hadn't\Nbeen so fraught with peril,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.12,0:17:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but asking you to act as bait\Nwas all I could scrape together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.86,0:17:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on—is this what I think it is? Brook?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.18,0:17:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a copy of the poneglyph.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.66,0:17:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.74,0:17:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,made it with seconds to spare, just as\NI finished transcribing the third sheet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.10,0:17:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,sheet And out of the blue\Ncame Big Mom herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.24,0:17:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe our eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.46,0:17:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You Karoo got past all the guards?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.38,0:17:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You even got past all\Nof the sweet generals?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.88,0:17:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you Karoo even know\Nwhat the other emperors of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.70,0:17:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,the sea would do to get\Ntheir hands on her road,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.96,0:17:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Poneglyph?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.54,0:17:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.00,0:18:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.64,0:18:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.08,0:18:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He not only reached, but\Ncopied our poneglyph?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.74,0:18:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.84,0:18:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oftentimes,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.02,0:18:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,even Big Mom's own beloved family is not\Npermitted in the treasure repository.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.94,0:18:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are something else!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.34,0:18:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps now I'm worthy of a panty-peak?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.10,0:18:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.01,0:18:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's already hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.00,0:18:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.94,0:18:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That takes care of one\Nof our big objectives!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.56,0:18:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That means all that's left\Nis for us to grab Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.06,0:19:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.84,0:19:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No one knows where they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.78,0:19:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.96,0:19:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They did pass by me a while ago, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.66,0:19:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but they're off here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.26,0:19:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Sanji's room?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.64,0:19:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No, just some weird guy that's\Nmade himself quite comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.96,0:19:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.20,0:19:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I know where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.44,0:19:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He has to be outside where\Nthere are no mirrors.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.54,0:19:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And just earlier, Luffy\Nmet Sanji in a field.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.14,0:19:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And they got in a big fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.84,0:20:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What could they be fighting\Nover in a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.78,0:20:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like to know too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.70,0:20:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji has assumed his position\Nas a son of the Vinsmoke family.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.68,0:20:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.34,0:20:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have had a very\Ncompelling reason to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.92,0:20:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So taking him back may not be so simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.96,0:20:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we are going to retrieve\Nhim, we must make haste.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.68,0:20:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I was going to tell you all\Nonce everyone was together,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.06,0:20:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but perhaps now is best\Nregrettably the wedding ceremony
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.76,0:20:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,planned for tomorrow is not\Ngoing to be a peaceful one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.58,0:20:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.32,0:20:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Your crew traveled here to whole cake island\Nwith peckham's as your guide, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.36,0:20:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, peckham's is he okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.08,0:20:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We got separated from him\Nright after we got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.80,0:20:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.50,0:20:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,he is fine but he got\Ninvolved in a conspiratorial
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.08,0:20:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,plot that nearly resulted\Nin him being fed to sharks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.92,0:21:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's wild, if I hadn't\Nnoticed what was happening,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.90,0:21:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,he would be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.04,0:21:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not people, you're like monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.80,0:21:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.98,0:21:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Barmaids really should be able\Nto hold their liquor better.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.76,0:21:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If they were going to send us girls, I\Nwish they gave us Sanji's Gourmet instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.76,0:21:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the one named Nami, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.90,0:21:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We all love a hot-blooded woman, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.32,0:21:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Word is Big Mom's already captured her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.32,0:21:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey pups, let's see if we can\Nwork out a trade for her tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.98,0:22:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, that's enough drinking for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.22,0:22:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The real festivities will\Ntake place after the ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.08,0:22:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Our alliance with Big Mom will turn\Nus into a truly formidable force.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.24,0:22:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And soon we will conquer\Nthe North Blue once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.22,0:22:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The same countries that\Nscored and insult us now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.74,0:22:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,will be groveling at the\Nfeet of the Germa kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.26,0:22:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Our day of revenge is finally upon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.38,0:22:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, we celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.40,0:22:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I never imagined that\Nthe embarrassment of the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.30,0:22:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Vinsmoke family would\Nprove to be so useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.40,0:22:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Even a failure is good for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.68,0:22:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.16,0:22:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,With Sanji used his bait,\Nwe sure hooked a Wapol.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.02,0:22:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Just think of when our foes see Big\NMom's flag on the German Armada.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.20,0:22:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll all turn tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.28,0:22:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be glorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.86,0:22:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The seas will be ours just\Nas they were meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.16,0:22:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now a toast to dear Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.16,0:23:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, do we gotta?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.88,0:23:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,To that piece of crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.72,0:23:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,To the useful failure!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.36,0:23:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.02,0:23:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's imperative that\Nthe Vinsmokes don't come
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.64,0:23:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,into contact with anyone\Nuntil tomorrow's party.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.60,0:23:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.84,0:23:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We already have guards on the third floor\Noverseeing the room that Reiju's in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.78,0:23:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Take extra precaution. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.46,0:23:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The Vinsmokes will meet\Ntheir maker as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.12,0:23:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say it out loud, you imbecile.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.14,0:23:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.90,0:23:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse them, you bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.02,0:24:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave my sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.02,0:24:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Bunch of low-class pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.02,0:25:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that Sanchi.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.64,0:25:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.68,0:25:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't tell you to wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.62,0:25:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.70,0:25:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat whatever's salvageable.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.46,0:25:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.84,0:25:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I dropped it on my way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.60,0:26:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's crushed and was rained on, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.96,0:26:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just another failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.94,0:26:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.58,0:26:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the best food ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.02,0:26:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.46,0:26:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all our favorites in one lunchbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.06,0:27:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to make this\Nfor the whole crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.76,0:27:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.28,0:27:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yum, yum.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.48,0:27:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.58,0:27:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.49,0:27:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That hit the spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.32,0:27:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I was going to shrivel up! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.56,0:27:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.42,0:27:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh. Good. Then leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.60,0:27:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.82,0:27:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going back!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.70,0:27:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,First, the captain of my own ship\Ncame all the way here for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.10,0:27:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And not only did I insult\Nand try to hurt him,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.36,0:27:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,but he also gave me no\Nresistance whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.78,0:27:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That alone is more than enough reason\Nfor me to not return to your crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.08,0:28:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Secondly, remember the old\Ngeezer who saved my life?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.22,0:28:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, the one I'm deeply indebted to?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.20,0:28:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,while he and the baratier,\Nthe place where I grew up,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.56,0:28:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,are being held hostage in case I run.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.02,0:28:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's also why I can't back\Nout of the ceremony tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.10,0:28:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Reason three, the evil family I'm related\Nto is walking right into Big Bomb's trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.88,0:28:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll all be murdered\Nin a matter of hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.76,0:28:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't run away, the whole\Nsituation will tidy up quite nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.62,0:29:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Realistically, I know they're monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.46,0:29:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't owe them a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.32,0:29:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The thought of them makes me sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.86,0:29:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You've always been a failure, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.46,0:29:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You deserve to rot and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.40,0:29:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, if anyone\Never asks about your family,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.56,0:29:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,you must never tell\Nthem who your father is.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.76,0:29:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Having you as a son is my greatest shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.64,0:29:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But despite all that crap...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.50,0:29:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And the torment.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.08,0:29:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't turn my back on those bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.32,0:30:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,that's why I can't leave\Nhere with you sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.88,0:30:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't and there's\Nno way to fix this
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.82,0:30:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So there you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.76,0:30:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.54,0:31:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.62,0:31:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you really feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.62,0:31:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.10,0:31:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.68,0:31:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.06,0:31:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to cooking already, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.56,0:31:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Sanji, what you gonna make us today?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.78,0:32:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one of you swiped the food?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.96,0:32:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all guilty as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.24,0:32:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,As your punishment, you'll\Ngo to bed with no dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.28,0:32:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, Luffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.72,0:32:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I give up to go
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.52,0:32:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,home to the sunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.04,0:33:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't muster the\Ncourage to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.38,0:33:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the wedding begins,\NI can't stop any of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.28,0:33:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially not on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.58,0:33:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I despise my whole family.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.32,0:33:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They've always treated me like dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.14,0:33:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.90,0:33:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I still want to save those scumbags.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.04,0:33:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.44,0:33:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's who you are!
